<title>NETHERLANDS: SAMAS DETAILS 1995/96 STOCK DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>SAMAS DETAILS 1995/96 STOCK DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samas Groep NV said on Thursday it had set its 1995/96 optional stock dividend at one new share per 30 held.</p>
<p>On June 26 the company announced it would pay a 1995/96 cash dividend of 1.80 guilders, up from 1.65 in 1994/95, or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Samas shares closed at 59.90 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Thursday, up 0.70 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
